[11]
\clipboard {GO}{GO: To develop and evaluate an IoT-based system for trucks, in 
collaboration with the partner truck company Hino Parañaque Subic GS Auto Inc.
 (SGSA\glsadd {SGSA}), that monitors real-time fuel levels, tracks routes using
 GPS, and detects unusual fuel consumption using machine learning, with the goa
l of improving driver safety, supporting rest scheduling, and facilitating proa
ctive vehicle maintenance through automated alerts using fuel and distance metr
ics, based on established service guidelines.}


